(b) of sub-section (1) of sub-section 3 of the Security of Pakistan Act, 1952 (XXXV of 1952), and those of ⁵[sub-section (2) of section 6 and] section 6A of that Act, shall mutatis mutandis apply in relation to a person detained under this Act as they apply in relation to a person detained under that Act.]
